      "content": "but it doesn't feel like a gift. it feels like a lie. i keep thinking about how easy it would be to just stop being a burden. like if i wasn't here, the world would just be slightly cleaner, you know? less of this fake kindness trying to cover up the fact that i'm just a bad person.",
